  "contract": "#911 Vile Fury (706006): effect 0 is aura 107 (flat modifier) misc 14 (SPELLMOD_COST), BasePoints -31 + die 1 = -30, class mask word0 0x200002 selecting Hivebreak (803193, Rage 200) and Carapace Crash (803199, Rage 250) and their other ranks; SpellInfo::CalcPowerCost applies SPELLMOD_COST at SpellInfo.cpp:3069, so 200 -> 170 and 250 -> 220 (Rage is stored x10, tooltip 3 Rage). Effect 1 is aura 333 (SPELL_AURA_ASCENSION_MOD_HIT_CHANCE_ALL_PCT), 1 + 1 = +2, folded into m_modMeleeHitChance and m_modSpellHitChance by StatSystem.cpp:999/1011. #954 Genesis (705962): aura 192 (MOD_MELEE_RANGED_HASTE) and aura 216 (HASTE_SPELLS), 3 + 1 = 4% each, handled at SpellAuraEffects.cpp:257/281; cast_speed_multiplier and attack_time_ms are divided by 1.04 (same method as bloodmage-consolidation.json). #1010 Enchanted Chitin (706955, 707872): aura 142 (MOD_BASE_RESISTANCE_PCT) misc 1 (physical), miscB 8 (1 << ITEM_SUBCLASS_ARMOR_MAIL), 24/49 + 1 = +25/+50; SpellEffectInfo::GetItemArmorSubclassMask returns 8 for exactly these ids (SpellInfo.cpp:371) and Player::UpdateArmor multiplies only the mail item armor (StatSystem.cpp:357). Mail chest 35842 has armor 706 in the item_template base dump (ArmorDamageModifier 0), so rank 1 adds 176.5 (int truncation: 176 or 177) and rank 2 adds 353; cloth chest 35859 (armor 169) is the control and must gain nothing. The rank 1 and rank 2 wearers are separate actors so the multipliers do not stack. Item ids and armor values were read from data/sql/base/db_world/item_template.sql, not from the running database.",
